Z||000000||Xtreme Fiero's||10-22-2000||09:57 AM||||<BR>Wich Trans is better for my new (to me) 85 GT, The 4.10 4-speed, Isuzu 5-speed, 5-speed getrag or a 3.xx 4-speed that came with the car. I want fast 0-60 times AND good top end (125mph+) what is the gearing for the isuzu & getrag trans's? how can I fugure top speeds for each of them? Thanks||||reg||5
Z||000001||Old Lar||10-22-2000||12:31 PM||||Getrag 4th  is .92, 5th is .74.<BR>You are looking for the best of both worlds 4.10 gears for fast aceleration and high top end.  Usually mutually exclusive.<P>The Getrag has the two overdrives that may get you to a higher top end.<P>The top end for the Fiero (as stock) was only rated at 120mph.  <P>I think you need more HP for higher top end.||||reg||1
